{"version":1,"content":"<p>由Rockstar Games打造、備受期待的《GTA6》於周三正式發售，距離前作問世已經過去13年。遊戲一經推出，便在Metacritic上創下了該網站有史以來的最高評分。換句話説，按照這家評分匯總網站的數據，《GTA6》瞬間成為史上媒體評價最高的遊戲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586968.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.742791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:17:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_hash":"06e8587476436de561dbeb9ea92683ec46a7da7bd11912ecf6594fe2ea9806c7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}